character.camp-chief-voice.epithet=Voice of the chief
dialogue.camp-chief-voice.intro.page1=You stand before the hut of the chief. The chief does not speak to strangers. I speak for the chief.
dialogue.camp-chief-voice.intro.page2=The chief has watched you walk our sand. A stranger who walks it often should become a friend, or leave.
dialogue.camp-chief-voice.intro.page3=Bring five sturdy chitin, taken from the Scarak, as a gift. Then swear the oath of the sand, and the camp will know you.
dialogue.camp-chief-voice.accept=I will earn the trust of the chief.
dialogue.camp-chief-voice.waiting=First the gift of chitin, then the oath. The chief listens.
dialogue.camp-chief-voice.oath=I swear by the sand: Feran blood is my blood, Scarak blood is my prey.
dialogue.camp-chief-voice.thanks=The chief names you friend of the camp. Take these, so every Feran who enters your home knows it.
quest.camp-chief-voice.title=The voice of the chief
quest.camp-chief-voice.description=The chief of a Feran camp speaks only through a voice, and asks the player for a gift and an oath.
quest.camp-chief-voice.short=Bring 5 sturdy chitin to the voice of the chief and swear the oath of the sand
quest.camp-chief-voice.gift.title=Give 5 sturdy chitin to the voice of the chief
quest.camp-chief-voice.oath.title=Swear the oath of the sand
character.feran-villager.name=Feran
character.camp-scarak-hunt.epithet=Scarak hunter
dialogue.camp-scarak-hunt.intro.page1=Smell that? Scarak. Their seekers scout our camp before the swarm comes.
dialogue.camp-scarak-hunt.intro.page2=Kill three seekers and the swarm stays blind. A Feran never refuses that hunt. Do you?
dialogue.camp-scarak-hunt.absent=No Scarak on the wind today. Rest while you can, stranger.
dialogue.camp-scarak-hunt.waiting=The seekers circle high. Strike when they dive.
dialogue.camp-scarak-hunt.thanks=Three seekers! The swarm stays blind. Take my spare spear, and their shells.
quest.camp-scarak-hunt.title=Blind the swarm
quest.camp-scarak-hunt.description=Scarak seekers scout a Feran camp before the swarm attacks. A hunter wants them dead.
quest.camp-scarak-hunt.short=Kill 3 Scarak seekers near the Feran hunter
dialogue.camp.decline=Not now.
character.camp-sand-skeletons.epithet=Camp guard
dialogue.camp-sand-skeletons.intro.page1=The dead walk out of the sand at our gates. My spear cannot leave the camp.
dialogue.camp-sand-skeletons.intro.page2=Break four of those sand skeletons for me. Bones go back to the dunes.
dialogue.camp-sand-skeletons.absent=The dunes are quiet. The dead sleep, for now.
dialogue.camp-sand-skeletons.waiting=I hear their bones rattle beyond the huts.
dialogue.camp-sand-skeletons.thanks=Four fewer walking dead. Take this, the camp owes you.
quest.camp-sand-skeletons.title=Bones to the dunes
quest.camp-sand-skeletons.description=Sand skeletons prowl around a Feran camp, and its guard cannot leave the gates.
quest.camp-sand-skeletons.short=Kill 4 sand skeletons near the Feran guard
dialogue.camp.give=Here they are.
character.camp-venom.epithet=Windwalker
dialogue.camp-venom.intro.page1=The wind carries my darts, but a dart without venom only stings.
dialogue.camp-venom.intro.page2=Bring me three venom sacs. Scorpions and snakes carry them, and they give them up badly.
dialogue.camp-venom.waiting=Three venom sacs. Mind the stingers.
dialogue.camp-venom.thanks=Good, still fresh. Take these daggers, and the antidotes. You may need them more than I do.
quest.camp-venom.title=Venom for the wind
quest.camp-venom.description=A Feran windwalker needs venom to coat its darts.
quest.camp-venom.short=Bring 3 venom sacs to the Feran windwalker
dialogue.camp.later=Not yet.
character.camp-bone-carver.epithet=Bone carver
dialogue.camp-bone-carver.intro.page1=The desert gives no iron, so we carve bone. Mine is all used up.
dialogue.camp-bone-carver.intro.page2=Bring me ten bone fragments, and I will carve you a weapon of your choice.
dialogue.camp-bone-carver.waiting=Ten fragments. The desert is full of old bones.
dialogue.camp-bone-carver.thanks=Good bone, dry and hard. Choose your weapon, I carved them while you were away.
quest.camp-bone-carver.title=Bone for the carver
quest.camp-bone-carver.description=A Feran bone carver has run out of bone and offers a weapon for more.
quest.camp-bone-carver.short=Bring 10 bone fragments to the Feran bone carver
dialogue.camp.bye=Good hunting.
character.camp-hyenas.epithet=Keeper of the stores
dialogue.camp-hyenas.intro.page1=Hyenas! They laugh all night and dig under the stores. Half our dried meat is gone.
dialogue.camp-hyenas.intro.page2=Chase them off for good. Three of them, and the rest will learn.
dialogue.camp-hyenas.absent=No laughing tonight. The stores are safe, for once.
dialogue.camp-hyenas.waiting=Listen. That laugh, out there. Go!
dialogue.camp-hyenas.thanks=Silence at last. Take some salt from the stores you saved, and their hides.
quest.camp-hyenas.title=Laughter at night
quest.camp-hyenas.description=Hyenas raid the food stores of a Feran camp every night.
quest.camp-hyenas.short=Kill 3 hyenas near the Feran keeper of the stores
dialogue.camp.hunt=I'll hunt them.
character.camp-crocodile.epithet=Water carrier
dialogue.camp-crocodile.intro.page1=A crocodile has taken the oasis. Nobody dares fill a jar any more.
dialogue.camp-crocodile.intro.page2=Kill it, and the water is ours again.
dialogue.camp-crocodile.absent=The water is calm today. Maybe the beast moved on.
dialogue.camp-crocodile.waiting=It waits under the water. Watch the reeds.
dialogue.camp-crocodile.thanks=The oasis is ours again! Its hide is yours, and this gold the camp kept for a day like this.
quest.camp-crocodile.title=The jaws of the oasis
quest.camp-crocodile.description=A crocodile keeps the Feran away from the water of their oasis.
quest.camp-crocodile.short=Kill the crocodile near the Feran water carrier
dialogue.camp.bring=I'll bring them.
character.camp-vultures.epithet=Meat drier
dialogue.camp-vultures.intro.page1=I hang the meat to dry in the sun, and the vultures dive on it the moment I turn around.
dialogue.camp-vultures.intro.page2=Bring down three of them. The others will find another table.
dialogue.camp-vultures.absent=Clear sky today. Not a single vulture.
dialogue.camp-vultures.waiting=They circle over the racks. Look up!
dialogue.camp-vultures.thanks=The racks are full again. Their feathers make fine fletching, and here is some silver.
quest.camp-vultures.title=Thieves of the sky
quest.camp-vultures.description=Vultures steal the meat a Feran hangs out to dry.
quest.camp-vultures.short=Kill 3 vultures near the Feran meat drier
dialogue.camp.giveup=There are none left around here.
character.camp-salt-trader.epithet=Salt trader
dialogue.camp-salt-road.intro.page1=The Kweebec of the forest have no salt. Their merchants pay well for ours, in gold and in green things.
dialogue.camp-salt-road.intro.page2=Carry these ten salts to a Kweebec merchant who trades with us. The forest is far, but the road is good.
dialogue.camp-salt-road.accept=I'll carry the salt.
dialogue.camp-salt-road.waiting=Find a Kweebec merchant who calls itself a friend of the Feran. The others will not know our salt.
dialogue.camp-salt-road.thanks=The salt reached the forest. Here is your share, as promised.
quest.camp-salt-road.title=The salt road
quest.camp-salt-road.description=A Feran salt trader sends salt to a Kweebec merchant of the forest, far from the desert.
quest.camp-salt-road.short=Bring 10 salt to a Kweebec merchant friend of the Feran
character.kweebec-feran-friend.epithet=Friend of the Feran
dialogue.camp-fresh-road.intro.page1=My friend the salt trader lives in a Feran camp, out in the desert. Nothing green grows there.
dialogue.camp-fresh-road.intro.page2=Will you carry these four pumpkins to the salt trader? The Feran have never tasted a pie.
dialogue.camp-fresh-road.accept=I'll take them to the desert.
dialogue.camp-fresh-road.waiting=The salt trader lives in a Feran camp, in the desert. Keep the pumpkins out of the sun.
dialogue.camp-fresh-road.thanks=The pumpkins arrived whole? Wonderful. Keep what the Feran gave you.
quest.camp-fresh-road.title=Green things for the desert
quest.camp-fresh-road.description=A Kweebec merchant sends pumpkins to its friend, a Feran salt trader in the desert.
quest.camp-fresh-road.short=Bring 4 pumpkins to a Feran salt trader in the desert
